        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I fourth (?) the suggestion of Formal Wear Sentinels. Particularly those characters where you’d never in a million years imagine them being stuffed in a dress or suit.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>After the mention of Legacy’s closet full of Legacy costumes in the episode, I picture Legacy definitely wearing his hero costumes underneath his suit, but sometimes he’s not careful and you can see cape poking out from underneath the suit jacket.</p>",
